// From piners scratch/spar/ov-optional-only.pine. Two overloads whose
// REQUIRED parameter lists are identical (`float x`); the second's extra
// parameter is optional, so it cannot disambiguate. TV rejects at 7:2; we
// are clean.
//@version=6
indicator("ov optional only")

f(float x) =>
    x + 1.0

f(float x, float scale = 1.0) =>
    x * scale

plot(f(1.0))
